# Normalise line endings on the way INTO git.
#
# This file exists because of a real incident. The working tree was converted
# to CRLF by a Windows checkout, and `git diff` then reported ~11,000 changed
# lines across 30 files -- of which exactly two files had any real change in
# them. The signal was completely buried, and the patch generated from that
# tree carried \r on every context line, so it would not apply cleanly
# anywhere.
#
# * text=auto tells git to store everything with LF in the repository
# regardless of what the checkout looks like locally, so this cannot recur.
* text=auto

*.py    text diff=python
*.md    text
*.yaml  text
*.yml   text
*.json  text
*.sh    text eol=lf
*.ipynb text

# Never touched: binary, and there should be none of these in the repo at all.
*.parquet binary
*.zip     binary
*.png     binary
